All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: +2 bonus to attack rolls, saving throws and damage, 10 additional hit points, +1 to charisma, immunity to any form of fear and charm for 17 rounds.~

@759 = ~Infernal Shout~
@7510 = ~Infernal Shout (Alteration)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: special

This spell amplifies the warlord's final cry into a devastating wave of sound. All creatures who hear the cry, with the exception of the caster and party members who recognize the incantation quickly enough to cover their ears (save vs. breath weapon) will suffer different effects depending upon the level of the caster, according to the following table:
Level 9: 10D4 damage, deafness for 1d4+2 rounds on a failed save
Level 12: 12D4 damage, deafness for 1 turn, 1D4 +2 rounds only if the saving throw is successful
Level 16: 14D4 damage, deafness for 1 turn, stun for 1D6 rounds if the saving throw is failed
Level 20: 16D4 damage, deafness for 12 rounds, stun for 1D4 +2 rounds, 1D2 rounds only if the saving throw is successful
Any damage inflicted by this spell can be halved by a successful save vs. spell. The same saving throw determines the secondary side effects.
Damage inflicted by this spell cannot kill a creature. A creature whose remaining hit points are less than the damage dealt is reduced to 1 hit point and falls unconscious.
A creature deafened by this spell can no longer be affected and cannot be affected by other wails (Banshee, Lich, etc.) until normal hearing returns.~
@75101 = ~Infernal Shout (Alteration)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: special

This spell amplifies the warlord's final cry into a devastating wave of sound. All creatures who hear the cry, with the exception of the caster and party members who recognize the incantation quickly enough to cover their ears (save vs. breath weapon) will suffer 16D4 damage, deafness for 12 rounds, stunning for 1D4 +2 rounds, 1D2 rounds only if saving throw is successful.
Any damage inflicted by this spell can be halved by a successful save vs. spell. The same saving throw determines the secondary side effects.
Damage inflicted by this spell cannot kill a creature. A creature whose remaining hit points are less than the damage dealt is reduced to 1 hit point and falls unconscious.
A creature deafened by this spell can no longer be affected and cannot be affected by other wails (Banshee, Lich, etc.) until normal hearing returns.~

@7512 = ~Invisibility (Illusion)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell hides the warlord from normal sight, together with everything he wears or handles. It also conceals surrounding magical effects and other visual clues to his presence. It does not hide his scent, sounds or voice. Objects he drops become visible again.
As long as he is invisible, he cannot be targeted, and only creatures that actively try to look for him have a chance to spot him. If he is spotted, attackers suffer a -4 penalty to attack rolls against him. He also gains a +4 bonus to saving throws.
The mage stays invisible throughout the duration of the spell, unless dispelled or a powerful divination spell negates it.~
@75121 = ~Invisibility (Illusion)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 25 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

