@7513 = ~Stoneskin~
@7514 = ~Stoneskin (Alteration, Evocation)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds / level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The warlord must be touching the ground when he casts this spell, otherwise it will have no effect. When the spell is cast, a shell of stone covers the mage like a second skin. This magical skin does not hinder him and protects him from weapon blows. The enemies of the mage can destroy the stoneskin by hitting it a number of times equal to half the level of the mage plus one. As an example, a level 14 warlord protected by Stoneskin could withstand without damage 8 hits before that protection is shattered.
Stoneskin protects only against physical weapon damage. It does not prevent elemental damage if the hit is successful, and does not dispel destructive spells.~
@75141 = ~Stoneskin (Alteration, Evocation)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 6 turns
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The warlord must be touching the ground when he casts this spell, otherwise it will have no effect. When the spell is cast, a shell of stone covers the mage like a second skin. This magical skin does not hinder him and protects him from weapon blows. The enemies of the mage can destroy the stoneskin by hitting it 11 times, after which the protection is shattered.
Stoneskin protects only against physical weapon damage. It does not prevent elemental damage if the hit is successful, and does not dispel destructive spells.~
