@7525 = ~Supernatural Sight~
@7526 = ~Supernatural Sight (Divination)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round / 2 levels
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

