Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell grants the recipient supernatural vision, revealing invisible, hidden, blurred and duplicated creatures and seeing through most illusions. Magic resistance does not stop it, and allied illusions are not revealed. Casting the spell also cures blindness in its recipient.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: flawed Supernatural Sight (5% chance each round of seeing "only" invisible creatures) for 1 turn.~

@7527 = ~Multi-Elemental Projection~
@7528 = ~Multi-Elemental Projection (Evocation)
Level: 5
Range: 20 m
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 75-degree cone, 10 meters long
Saving Throw: half

This spell creates a multitude of small elemental orbs, randomly composed of fire, cold, electricity, acid or force, which spread in a fan in front of the mage's joined hands. All creatures within the cone of effect will suffer 10D6 points of damage, in an overall balanced proportion of the 5 elements. Those who make a successful save vs. spell will only suffer half damage.
The damage increases with the mage's level, according to the following table:
Level 12: 10D8
Level 15: 10D10
Level 18: 10D12~
