@7529 = ~Strike of the Assassin~
@7530 = ~Strike of the Assassin (Enchantment, Alteration)
Level: 5
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 7 rounds
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

The warlord discovered this unexpectedly devastating spell while seeking to focus his power on a single target. When he casts it, he teleports to the chosen creature. All his attacks during the following round automatically become critical hits and can kill the target if it fails a save vs. death. He also gains a +4 bonus to THAC0 and damage against that target for the duration of the spell.~

